- ne-a #37 and ne-b #13 are right that the blog breaks are ugly, and wrong that the ZWSP lines and the Q16–Q20 heading promotion can be removed here. The checker compares heading levels, ZWSP counts, and block counts with the Korean source, which still has those breaks.
